%---------------- ISPF Tutorial 4 of 5: Actions --------------------------%
%Command ===>_ZCMD
+
 Enter B, E, V, or I in the Act field beside a row and press Enter.
 The action applies to that row in the filtered and sorted list.
+
 B calls Browse, E calls Edit, V calls View, and I displays volume,
 size, device, and migration information. Multiple rows can be selected
 together. Use the command field for list commands, not row actions.
+
 ULS intentionally excludes delete, rename, copy, move, and allocation
 commands. Those operations can change catalog contents and require
 additional installation-specific validation.
+
 Enter NEXT, PREV, 1-5, or END to navigate.
)END
